# 10 — Student Artifacts

Applies when creating/editing notes, worksheets, labs, quizzes, tests, study guides, or keys.

- Obey `docs/standards/GUIDED_NOTES_STANDARD.md`, `docs/standards/STUDENT_HANDOUT_STANDARD.md`, `docs/standards/ASSESSMENT_LAYOUT_STANDARD.md`.
- Guided Notes = primary student artifact; Science Journal = secondary.
- Generous Grade 4 writing space, printability, grayscale quality, no answer leakage on student pages.
- All scored work = raw score + percentage. Keys live in the teacher bundle only.
- Label provenance (`SOURCE`/`ADAPTED`/`CUSTOM`/`EXTENSION`) and priority (`CORE`/`FLEX`/`EXTENSION`).
